{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>現代數位生活充斥各式壓縮檔案，您是否曾為手機上無法快速處理 ZIP、RAR、7Z 等格式而煩惱？《Unrar Tool PRO》正是解決這些問題的理想方案，它是一款功能全面的檔案壓縮與解壓縮工具，今天限時免費中，無論您是商務人士、學生或任何需要隨時隨地管理檔案的用戶，都能從其快速、安全又多功能的設計中受益。</p>\n\n<h2>強大加密功能與跨格式檔案處理</h2>\n<p>這款應用不僅能快速解壓縮及建立多種主流格式檔案，如 ZIP、RAR、7Z，更支援分割與加密壓縮，確保您的資料萬無一失。它提供直觀的本地檔案管理介面，輕鬆瀏覽、編輯圖片、影片、文件與音訊，甚至整合了指紋與臉部辨識，全面提升您的數位安全。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-74-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-29-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-30-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Zip Unzip – Unrar Tool PRO</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-30T00:13:53.636048+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}